    "body": "Note from mkinney's side:\n- Likely cause: PR #1787 (refuse unsupported Sodick angle-word moves, #1496) merged near PR #1793 (the ALC400G machine file). After #1787, the tapered punch is refused at the angle-word check first, so the test no longer gets the \"no guide heights\" refusal that it expects. Each PR passed alone. The failure came from the two together.\n- A Codex review of your fix PR #1857 is queued now, so that it can merge sooner. The review posts a comment and the label only. It does not change the draft state.\n",
